{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_010azu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_010azu02_title", "source_sha256": "9895dfc6f2251684ba8b4788b48a8e4501636e3a64e4161f156a845b14cc25af", "ja": "あずさとおでかけ2", "zh": "和梓出游2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_010azu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_010azu02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1fc00d5ed931174710ada67ad1d7b64bd8aa484c43a3bf41475f635696169304", "ja": "あずさとおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是与梓一同外出的片段。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_010azu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_010azu02_1000_010azu", "source_sha256": "5fc84fe4f4105094cbcc63fd077ae71afd80d4061ce323b033a8052281af4300", "ja": "まぁ……！　{$P$}さん、\nとっても大きな木がありますよ。なんの木でしょう？", "zh": "哎呀……！{$P$}先生，那里有一棵特别大的树呢。会是什么树呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_010azu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_010azu02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "9cc275d37a9662dfe16a0c8a2c31c71b66e1cb8a2286000b1a9a132dfc1b75e3", "ja": "これはヒバの木といって、この地方の特産らしいです。\nゆっくりと、長い時間をかけて成長するんだとか。", "zh": "这叫扁柏树，听说是这个地区的特产。\n据说它会慢慢地，经过漫长的岁月成长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_010azu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_010azu02_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "30d79915839205642bad54180e6f76a9183530322fc84e1b714c42a7b0e04c46", "ja": "そうなんですか……とっても立派な木ですね。\n何百年も、何千年も生きてきたように見えて……。", "zh": "这样啊……真是一棵非常气派的树呢。看起来仿佛已经活了几百年、几千年……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_010azu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_010azu02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "16c567835ac670ba0cfd8c70d38d5466f4ad65d1083623880a480898dfcc7fad", "ja": "この木はいい香りがするので、アロマオイルや\n石鹸なんかにしたりもするみたいですよ。", "zh": "听说这种树的香味很不错，所以好像也会被制成香薰油和香皂之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_010azu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_010azu02_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "98dd7b76b9230c53c2d78ee7fcfb1b9faee72495736528e8ab27b22ca7cef441", "ja": "まあ！　劇場のみんなへのお土産にぴったりですね。\nこの近くにも、売っているんでしょうか？", "zh": "哎呀！拿来当作送给剧场大家的伴手礼正合适呢。附近也有卖的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_010azu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_010azu02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d1f17ec510b7635be2b051a9f53c312cd0a50c9610e92db71257d1335f66f3c3", "ja": "確か、お店があったと思います。\nまだ時間もありますし、寄ってみましょうか。", "zh": "我记得这附近好像有家店。\n时间还早，要不要顺路去看看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_010azu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_010azu02_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "5c7f04d2bde569e72fdf3013604652c160c643128c9c7e26eb0f51d7d0a0169d", "ja": "はい、ぜひ！　……でも、もう少しだけ、\nこの立派な木を眺めていてもいいですか？", "zh": "好的，当然！……不过，我可以再看一会儿这棵壮观的大树吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_010azu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_010azu02_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "1187f5a9d078ac90990d89a3eb4cc42ca94700e84c7ef1f8e4bdc8b499800322", "ja": "ゆっくりと、長い時間をかけて。……私と\n{$P$}さんの関係も、願わくば……。", "zh": "慢慢地，历经漫长的岁月。……我和\n{$P$}先生之间的关系，要是也能这样就好了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0218_story_010azu02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0218_story_010azu02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3b1eeef13bfaf573277ef2203705ece01dbc317d140f84ba8b8b89437d33ff9e", "ja": "（そう言って笑ったあずささんから、ふわっといい\n香りがした気がした。きっと、ヒバの魔法かな……）", "zh": "说完这话后微笑的梓小姐身上，仿佛飘来了一阵淡淡的香气。一定是罗汉柏的魔法吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
